    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296476689
    m_Localized: Load this save? Unsaved progress will be lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296476690
    m_Localized: Saved to {0}!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296476691
    m_Localized: Quit to Desktop?\n\nAny unsaved progress will be lost.\nMake sure
      to sleep in a bed to save!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296476692
    m_Localized: Return to Main Menu?\n\nAny unsaved progress will be lost.\nMake
      sure to sleep in a bed to save!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296476693
    m_Localized: 'Delete Save File?


      This action cannot be undone.

      All
      your progress will be permanently lost!'
